### Open with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above each block.
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Health (pings the database)
GET {{base}}/health

### Ingest a batch (first call → 201)
# @name ingest
POST {{base}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-3

{
  "customerId": "acme",
  "items": [
    { "rawTitle": "Cotton t-shirt XL", "declaredValue": 12.50, "currency": "USD", "originCountry": "VN", "destinationCountry": "US" },
    { "rawTitle": "Kids jumpsuit", "declaredValue": 30, "destinationCountry": "US" },
    { "rawTitle": "Cat hoodie soft warm", "declaredValue": "19.99", "destinationCountry": "JP" }
  ]
}

### Same key again → 200 with "replayed": true, no duplicate batch
POST {{base}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-3

{ "customerId": "acme", "items": [ { "rawTitle": "ignored, batch already exists" } ] }

### Read a shipment (uses the first id from the ingest response above; wait ~2s for classification)
GET {{base}}/shipments/{{ingest.response.body.shipments[0].id}}

### Validation error → 400
POST {{base}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "acme", "items": [ { "rawTitle": "x", "declaredValue": -5 } ] }

### Unknown id → 404
GET {{base}}/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
